\cf0 Controls: WASD to move, E to Interact\
\
You are a space researcher working from a space station in our solar system; build and launch cube shaped satellites- CubeSats- to complete missions and collect data!\
\
Select a mission from the terminal to your left and read it carefully; then construct a CubeSat capable of accomplishing the mission.\
\
Launch your CubeSat, get more missions, repeat!\
\
What is a Cubesat?\
\
A CubeSat is a cube shaped miniature satellite, typically no bigger than a Rubik\'92s cube, which can be combined with other CubeSats to create larger, modular satellites. \
\
They are used in our real world for research, technological demonstrations, education, and commercial services!\
